Houses burn down, cities fall to ruin,
there's no place to run from all the chaos.

194
00:10:20,780 --> 00:10:24,309
And in the midst of all this
madness, there's a single tree.

195
00:10:24,660 --> 00:10:26,957
No matter what happens, it never falls.

196
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:29,417
And no matter how much
the island is destroyed,

197
00:10:29,500 --> 00:10:32,676
