and build it all up again.

198
00:10:33,680 --> 00:10:35,980
It's the strongest tree in the world.

199
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:39,740
As far as anyone knows, only a few exist.

200
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:42,640
It's known as the jewel tree.

201
00:10:43,180 --> 00:10:44,600
Adam, huh?

202
00:10:45,700 --> 00:10:47,220
Okay, so what?

203
00:10:47,940 --> 00:10:52,293
Every so often a piece of wood from
that tree shows up on the black market

204
00:10:52,900 --> 00:10:55,018
I've wanted one for a long time now,

205
00:10:55,160 --> 00:10:58,157
but the going price is two
hundred million berries,

206
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,680
