You use our money to buy some stupid
log and then you brag about it?

212
00:11:09,300 --> 00:11:10,760
Told you! Shut up!

213
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:24,520
A long time ago, I decided that I was done
building ships for the rest of my life.

214
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:29,198
And yet, I couldn't help but follow
in the footsteps of my old master.

215
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:32,400
And soon enough, I found
myself designing a ship.

216
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:39,577
Now, my hope is to use that
special wood to build it.

217
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:42,240
to put all my heart into one last ship.

218
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:45,460
A ship of dreams that
can sail across any sea.

219
00:11:54,620 --> 00:11:56,600
I've had the blueprints for ages.

220
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,000
Now I finally have the wood.

221
00:11:59,460 --> 00:12:01,260
All that's left is to make it.

222
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:04,740
