Uh-huh, because that way I'll know
my masterpiece is in good hands.

228
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:26,136
Trust me, that's all I could ask for.

229
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:29,205
Well, that and you kind
of paid for it already.

230
