233
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:43,657
Mark my words I'll show you the
best damn ship you've ever seen yeah

234
00:12:43,740 --> 00:12:48,517
you're a ship right after all you can
pretend all you like but in the end

235
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:50,417
you're just like old Tom ain't ya

236
00:12:50,500 --> 00:12:54,537
guess you're right

237
00:12:54,620 --> 00:13:00,017
I get it now it took

238
00:13:00,100 --> 00:13:05,580
