the pride Tom felt when he died.

239
00:13:06,500 --> 00:13:07,330
Yeah!

240
00:13:09,620 --> 00:13:12,040
You're the best, Franky! Thank you!

241
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:13,737
We'd be happy to take your show!

242
00:13:13,820 --> 00:13:14,650
All right!

243
00:13:14,733 --> 00:13:16,520
Now on to the next island! Luffy!

244
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:20,100
We have a new show! Get him! Get him!

245
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,157
This is bad!

246
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:33,897
I didn't think those bastards
would come after us so soon.

247
00:13:33,980 --> 00:13:36,057
Damn it, I bet Luffy's
still sleeping, too.

248
00:13:36,140 --> 00:13:38,434
I got to warn him before it's too late.

249
00:13:40,020 --> 00:13:40,850
No way.

250
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,460
It's the Navy.

251
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,437
They're here to arrest the pirates.

252
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:49,057
Even after they saved the mayor's
life, they won't show them any mercy.

253
00:13:49,140 --> 00:13:50,960
Hey, you see that over there?

254
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:55,157
That's Vice Admiral Garp's ship,
straight from headquarters.

255
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,700
Wait, did you say Garp?

256
00:13:56,860 --> 00:13:59,437
The same Garp that nearly
captured Gold Roger?

257
00:13:59,520 --> 00:14:02,597
Over and over again, he's a living legend.

258
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:04,457
They're not messing around.

259
00:14:04,540 --> 00:14:08,305
